[{"id":3064677467,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDMwNjQ2Nzc0Njc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/events/3064677467","actor":{"login":"andfanilo","id":5351877,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTE4Nzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5351877?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo","html_url":"https://github.com/andfanilo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-02-24T09:47:50Z","label":{"name":"bug","color":"d73a4a"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/comments/590528249","html_url":"https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/issues/1134#issuecomment-590528249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/1134","id":590528249,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU5MDUyODI0OQ==","user":{"login":"andfanilo","id":5351877,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTE4Nzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5351877?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo","html_url":"https://github.com/andfanilo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-02-24T20:16:56Z","updated_at":"2020-02-24T20:16:56Z","body":"Answer from the [Bokeh thread](https://github.com/bokeh/bokeh/issues/4930#issuecomment-590461896).\r\n\r\n> Yes versions definitely JS/Python need to match, in general. Not just between major releases, either. Are you intending to hard code a fixed BokehJS version but accept JSON output from arbitrary Python Bokeh versions? I would not regard that as reliable.\r\n\r\nThere should be a BokehJS 2.0.0 soon (like this week ?) on which to test the `bokeh_chart` and see if BokehJS 2 accepts Bokeh Python items from v1 and v2, and hope for the best. Otherwise there will be a need to tell users to stall their Bokeh upgrade ?\r\n\r\nFrom the [Bokeh embed doc](https://docs.bokeh.org/en/latest/docs/user_guide/embed.html#json-items), was the JSON technique chosen over the HTML to prevent the sending of malicious HTML files to Streamlit ? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/comments/590528249/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andfanilo","id":5351877,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTE4Nzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5351877?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo","html_url":"https://github.com/andfanilo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/comments/597093420","html_url":"https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/issues/1134#issuecomment-597093420","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/1134","id":597093420,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU5NzA5MzQyMA==","user":{"login":"andfanilo","id":5351877,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTE4Nzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5351877?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo","html_url":"https://github.com/andfanilo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-10T13:44:48Z","updated_at":"2020-03-10T13:44:48Z","body":"Following the announcement of [Bokeh 2.0.0](https://medium.com/@bokeh/announcing-bokeh-2-0-647042d0d977), I can confirm that Bokeh 2.0.0 on the user Python env doesn't work with Streamlit.\r\n\r\nIf you want to try Bokeh 2.0.0 in Streamlit, you will need to rebuild Streamlit with the new [BokehJS 2.0.0](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@bokeh/bokehjs) : \r\n\r\n1. `bokehjs` is now `@bokeh/bokehjs` so in `frontend/package.json` change `\"bokehjs\": \"^1.2.0\"` to `\"@bokeh/bokehjs\": \"^2.0.0\"`. \r\n2. `yarn install`\r\n3. in `frontend/src/components/elements/BokehChart` change `import { embed as BokehEmbed } from \"bokehjs\"` to `import { embed as BokehEmbed } from \"@bokeh/bokehjs\"`\r\n4. `yarn start` then `streamlit run app.py` \r\n\r\nAlso unfortunately, by doing so you break compatibility with Bokeh 1.x, so Bokeh 1.x in a user Python env won't work anymore.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/comments/597093420/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andfanilo","id":5351877,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNTE4Nzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5351877?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo","html_url":"https://github.com/andfanilo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andfanilo/events{/privacy}",